Acceptance Criteria: 
- A new user can register and is immediately logged in
- A returning user can log in with valid credentials
- Invalid credentials show an error without revealing which field is wrong
- Refreshing the page preserves the session
- Navigating to a protected route while logged out redirects to /login
- Logging out clears session and blocks protected route access
- "Remember me" persists session after browser close (if checked)
- Login link should be integrated in src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx if no user has been logged in
- Log out link should be integrated in src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx if a user has been logged in
- src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx should not be visible in /login or /register routes